  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>]</mo></math>&nbsp;denote the greatest integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>t</mi></math>. Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>cosec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi></math>"
  },
